- My internship was at Fuji Foto DS.

+ anything else
- You can ask about any topic from my CV.\nTry keywords like "education", "skills", "React", or "experience".
- If you have more questions, feel free to ask about specific projects, skills, or my general background.

+ *
- Hmm, I do not understand. Try asking about education, skills, projects, dream, hope, current job, or school.
- I am not sure how to respond. Could you rephrase your question or ask about my CV topics?